    "description": "Hand Carved Figural Smoking Pipe\nWood Construction with Face Motif\nVintage Folk Art Design\nThis hand-carved wooden smoking pipe features a distinctive figural face bowl, showcasing a primitive folk art aesthetic. The artisan has utilized the natural grain of the wood to highlight the carved features, creating a unique functional object that doubles as decorative sculpture. These pieces represent a blend of utilitarian craftsmanship and creative folk art traditions.\nHand-carved wooden bowl with a human face motif\nTwo-piece construction with a removable wooden stem\nNatural wood finish showing visible grain and hand-tool marks\nMeasures approximately 6 inches in length (ruler visible in photos)\nCondition:\nGood vintage condition with wear consistent with age and use. The wood surface shows natural patina and light surface abrasions. The interior of the bowl shows darkening and residue from previous use. The stem fits securely into the shank. No structural repairs or significant cracks are evident.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so. Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nOur Business hours: Monday - Friday  8:00 am to 4:00 pm Central\nNew items and unique treasures are added daily, come back soon!",
